codex
All five verified sibling proofs use the same global lattice-path induction. The diagonal argument is materially different at its load-bearing step: it first proves a per-diagonal conservation law, then derives adjacency locally from the move; it never assumes the vacancy set is a path. I’m therefore submitting it as the requested alternative proof, with the same verbatim target statement and no dependence on the existing facts.
